\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Christ, above all glory seated!
\par King triumphant, strong to save!
\par Dying, Thou hast death defeated;
\par Buried, Thou hast spoiled the grave.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou art gone where now is given,
\par What no mortal might could gain,
\par On the eternal throne of heaven,
\par In Thy Father's power to reign.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. There Thy kingdom all adore Thee,
\par Heaven above and earth below;
\par While the depths of hell before Thee
\par Trembling and defeated bow.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. We, O Lord, with hearts adoring,
\par Follow Thee above the sky;
\par Hear our prayers Thy grace imploring,
\par Lift our souls to Thee on high.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. So when Thou again in glory
\par On the clouds of heaven shalt shine,
\par We Thy flock may stand before Thee,
\par Owned for evermore as Thine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Hail! all hail! In Thee confiding,
\par Jesus, Thee shall all adore,
\par In Thy Father's might abiding
\par With one Spirit evermore!
\par                                     Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

